<title>UK: Union Bank of Estonia sets 30 mln mark FRN.</title>
<headline>Union Bank of Estonia sets 30 mln mark FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   UNION BANK OF ESTONIA</p>
<p> AMT    30 MLN DEM    BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    16.JUN.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    +80 BP     PAY DATE    16.JUN.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.53     ISS PRICE  99.53     FULL FEES   75 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
